  "body": "### What are you trying to do\n\nLots of different machines have difference smoothing algorithms, and ways to impliment them.\nFanuc g5.1 XXXXX (different numbers here depending on control version)\nseimens g642\nGenerally from top level there's normally an \"auto\" mode. When doing a contour or finish toolpath, it sets the smoothing algorithm to maximum accuracy. When roughing, the stock to leave determins the agressiveness of the algorithm. ie: .5mm stock to leave gives g5.1 p1 r10 (maximum roughing). .05mm stock to leave outputs g5.1 p1 r1(maximum accuracy)\n\n### How you imagine it working\n\n_No response_",
